# Northline frontend — environment variables
#
# Nothing is REQUIRED to run or build the public site. The public Wix client id
# lives in src/lib/wix.ts (it is public and safe to ship).
#
# Only add variables here if a future server-side feature needs a Wix admin
# credential (client secret / API key). Those are secrets: keep them in a local
# .env (git-ignored), never commit them, and never expose them to the browser.

# WIX_CLIENT_SECRET=
# WIX_API_KEY=
